Cell["\<\
Illustration. A directed network with edge weights; the dim edges are the \
full graph, the glowing coral curve is the cheapest path between two nodes -- \
what the tropical mat-vec selects.\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,ExpressionUUID->"f37ebd3e-ce16-4ddb-84d1-883771e479ac"],

