Cell["\<\
Illustration. A scattering of coral dots (class +1) and blue dots (class -1) \
lives on opposite sides of a piecewise-linear crease that winds across the \
plane -- the decision boundary of a trained ReLU classifier.\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
