Cell["\<\
Illustration. A richly folded paper landscape -- the kind of piecewise-linear \
surface a stack of ReLU units produces. Each ridge is one ReLU crease line; \
each flat facet is one activation pattern of the network. Doubling the number \
of units roughly quadruples the number of facets, which is the scaling law of \
\[Section]16.\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Helvetica",
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,ExpressionUUID->"698d6ab7-eb4c-4f94-a7df-dc766241e2db"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Quantitatively, by Zaslavsky's theorem ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[
   FormBox[
    TagBox["n",
     HoldForm],
    TraditionalForm],
   TraditionalForm,
   Editable->True]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "396652b4-955c-4fc3-92a1-f1633c492c38"],
 " straight lines in general position in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[
   FormBox[
    TagBox[
     SuperscriptBox["R", "2"],
     HoldForm],
    TraditionalForm],
   TraditionalForm,
   Editable->True]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fb2191dc-eb7c-4350-bc43-24a9630fa56f"],
 " partition the plane into at most"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b603d109-9140-4323-b522-01bc64ee648e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Z", "(", "n", ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", "n", "+", 
      TemplateBox[{"n", "2"},
       "Binomial"]}], "\[LongEqual]", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["n", "2"], "+", "n", "+", "2"}], ")"}]}]}],
    HoldForm],
   TraditionalForm],
  TraditionalForm,
  Editable->True]], "DisplayFormula",
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"dfbbf9b6-b2b4-48ff-95f1-b1ddf93574ef"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "regions. That is the Zhang-Naitzat-Lim upper bound for a 1-hidden-layer \
ReLU classifier with 2D input. We sweep ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[
   FormBox[
    TagBox[
     RowBox[{"n", "\[Element]", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "2", ",", "4", ",", "8", ",", "16", ",", "32", ",", "64", ",", "96"}], 
       "}"}]}],
     HoldForm],
    TraditionalForm],
   TraditionalForm,
   Editable->True]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "547feff7-05e0-41fd-a889-282b45958308"],
 " on two-moons (3 seeds each), count realised activation patterns on a 400\
\[Times]400 grid, and compare to the bound."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9069798d-1472-449e-ba6c-5d008686ad12"],

